==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kagamine Rin & Len (Enemy)|Kagamine Rin & Len]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[MikuGory|MikuGories]] spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

